nts","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":8,"closed_issues":4466,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-02-14T11:52:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T23:48:31Z","due_on":"2025-03-03T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T09:35:35Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2024-12-29T00:17:29Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T15:22:25Z","closed_at":"2025-01-22T15:22:25Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.4.dev7\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.dev7 - Windows 10.0.22631 - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6636) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-13900K (32 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe viewport size doesn't match what's defined in the project settings when running a project with floating game window. This can be misleading, as what you see when running the project no longer matches the editor by default (with the `disabled` and `canvas_items` stretch modes).\n\nFor example, if you run a project that uses a viewport size of 1920x1080, the actual window size will be set to that, so the viewport size will be smaller than that (typically around 1900x1020 for 1920x1080). This is because the UI elements that are part of the game window take up space away from the game viewport.\n\nA way to fix this is to resize the window on launch to take the controls into account. In other words, the viewport should remain 1920x1080 and the window will be a bit larger than that as a result. (If there isn't enough space available on screen, the window should be maximized instead to make the viewport size as close as possible to the \"real\" one).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Run a project in the editor with the game in a separate window.\n- Notice how the displayed viewport resolution in the top-right corner doesn't match the size defined in the project settings.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/3d/platformer, but any project should do.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100883/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100883/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}